    <div>
      <p class="label zh">關於我</p><p class="label en">About me</p>
      <h2 id="about-h" style="font-size:clamp(25px,3vw,34px);margin:8px 0 24px" class="zh">嗨，我是李瑤琳醫師</h2>
      <h2 style="font-size:clamp(25px,3vw,34px);margin:8px 0 24px" class="en">Hello, I'm Dr. Lee</h2>
      <div class="letter">
        <p class="zh">腦下垂體的病人，常常帶著一疊檢查報告和一連串沒有答案的問題來到門診。我希望每一次看診結束時，你能清楚知道三件事：腫瘤在哪裡、它對你有什麼影響、接下來有哪些選擇。</p>
        <p class="zh">我在奇美醫院擔任神經外科主治醫師，次專科專注於腦下垂體、顱底與內視鏡手術。我也持續在約翰霍普金斯大學進修應用生醫工程，因為我相信更好的工具，能讓手術更安全。</p>
        <p class="en">Pituitary patients often arrive with a stack of reports and many unanswered questions. By the end of each visit, I want you to know three things: where the tumour is, how it affects you, and what your options are.</p>
        <p class="en">I'm an attending neurosurgeon at Chi Mei Medical Center with a subspecialty focus in pituitary, skull base and endoscopic surgery. I'm also completing an MSc in Applied Biomedical Engineering at Johns Hopkins, because better tools make surgery safer.</p>
